ky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-20T19:14:36.687Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-20T19:14:39.448Z", "text": "Seedorf escolhe m\u00fasica-tema do Chicago Bulls para a entrada do Corinthians em campo\n\nJogadores deixaram os vesti\u00e1rios para o aquecimento antes de enfrentar o Vit\u00f3ria ao som da trilha sonora que embalou o lend\u00e1rio time de basquete dos Estados Unidos"}]}, {"team": "chi", "query": "\"Chicago Bulls\"", "hour": "2026-10-20T20:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:bvn5oncrh2mie4nxuzbiqjmi/app.bsky.feed.post/3mydho5u2rs23", "author_did": "did:plc:bvn5oncrh2mie4nxuzbiqjmi", "handle": "juliapoe.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:23:44.652Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-20T20:23:44.934Z", "text": "The Bulls exercised team options on the contracts of Matas Buzelis and Noa Essengue through the 2027-28 season:"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:qjj44p47avghsz4iqbhutwsr/app.bsky.feed.post/3mydhf7rrbv2g", "author_did": "did:plc:qjj44p47avghsz4iqbhutwsr", "handle": "chicagosports.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:18:41.593Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-20T20:18:45.239Z", "text": "Chicago Bulls exercise rookie options for Matas Buzelis and Noa Essengue"}]}, {"team": "chi", "query": "\"Chicago Bulls\"", "hour": "2026-10-20T21:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:yq3y5mnmxsnp5k7iowykn6cm/app.bsky.feed.post/3mydlt52oss2e", "author_did": "did:plc:yq3y5mnmxsnp5k7iowykn6cm", "handle": "beavisetc.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-20T21:38:06.560Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-20T21:38:06.842Z", "text": "On the opening day of the NBA season, one team is on every fan\u2019s mind. That\u2019s right, it\u2019s the Chicago Bulls"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:3eiwusriemnybmaqb4adhb45/app.bsky.feed.post/3mydjvex7pt2q", "author_did": "did:plc:3eiwusriemnybmaqb4adhb45", "handle": "porcellato.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-20T21:03:34+00:00", "indexed_at": "2026-10-20T21:03:34.550Z", "text": "Can the Chicago Bulls win 30 games this season? How the NBA\u2019s new anti-tanking rules may come into play. https://ift.tt/vDJgLAP"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:pg2qb6t6uqlb3riqxv3kdajw/app.bsky.feed.post/3mydju5bmpc2m", "author_did": "did:plc:pg2qb6t6uqlb3riqxv3kdajw", "handle": "centraldotimao.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-20T21:02:52.856Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-20T21:02:53.539Z", "text": "Escolha do t\u00e9cnico \ud83c\udff4\ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\n\nTrilha sonora ic\u00f4nica do Chicago Bulls \u00e9 escolhida por Seedorf para aquecimento do Corinthians. Confira:\n\ncentraldotimao.com.br/noticias/see..."}]}, {"team": "chi", "query": "\"Chicago Bulls\"", "hour": "2026-10-20T22:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:52p4qu75mkfalyk2xwjb4ise/app.bsky.feed.post/3mydpvkxssc27", "author_did": "did:plc:52p4qu75mkfalyk2xwjb4ise", "handle": "baseballfrank.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-20T22:51:03.213Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-20T22:51:06.134Z", "text": "Google, this wasn\u2019t what I was asking but sure whatever. \n\n(I know I shouldn\u2019t objectify professional athletes, forgive me for I have sinned)"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:jszy2fvtipwprnjhe7pxytfv/app.bsky.feed.post/3mydpkcq3ae2n", "author_did": "did:plc:jszy2fvtipwprnjhe7pxytfv", "handle": "chicagotribune.com", "created_at": "2026-10-20T22:44:43.897Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-20T22:44:45.941Z", "text": "Chicago Bulls exercise rookie options for Matas Buzelis and Noa Essengue"}]}, {"team": "chi", "query": "\"Chicago Bulls\"", "hour": "2026-10-20T23:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:26wgz535b5amb6omncpzgr7j/app.bsky.feed.post/3mydr5gyzv22l", "author_did": "did:plc:26wgz535b5amb6omncpzgr7j", "handle": "dubs0203.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-20T23:13:21.245Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-20T23:13:22.442Z", "text": "\ud83d\ude02"}]}]